Z||000000||Formula||07-22-2001||12:01 AM||||Finished getting everything hooked up today. <BR>Fuel pump was working, it was getting spark, tried different timing settings but none worked.  lowered the fuel pressure by 1/4, probably around 5 psi now.  the choke was opening, spark plugs had some gas on them, I think it eventually flooded but everything seems fine but its not working.  We lowered the float levels too.  <P>would the starter being too tight cause the motor not to run at all?||||reg||1
